Rāvaṇa recalls Brahmā warning and orders guards and Kumbhakarṇa woken --- Demons pile meat mountains and wine jars before snoring giant --- Demons perfume garland and praise him with conches and drums --- Demons beat him with clubs maces trees while elephants trample him --- Kumbhakarṇa wakes hungry and devours meat and drink --- Yūpākṣa reports Rāma siege and Rāvaṇa defeat --- Kumbhakarṇa vows to slay all then Mahōdara sends him to Rāvaṇa --- Kumbhakarṇa strides to palace scattering fear struck monkeys